  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CoCoNut Waste Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To achieve a green-circular economy and create livelihood opportunities through value addition to coconut husks waste in the La Nkwantanang-Madina Municipality.Specific objectives:1. Establish coconut waste aggregation system in the target municipality;2.Institute a processing centre to convert coconut waste into selected useable products including cocopeat, paper and charcoal;3.Create linkages with market actors to procure value added products;</narrative>
  </description>
